# P12 round 4: the Morph target on Tracker+. Instr held + Up x3 picks Synth 1, the Instrument Parameters key opens the Synth screen, Shift
# held + Right x2 moves the part's Morph target from the default slot 1 to slot 3 (popup "Morph target: 3", the patch panel heading
# "Slot 0  Morph 3:"). plus_flows.sh reads the target afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_MORPH): 1, 2, 3 and nothing else.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus
title: Morph target on Tracker+ (P12)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
tap Params
wait 1200ms
expect text "Slot 0:"
press Shift
wait 300ms
tap Right
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 400ms
release Shift
wait 600ms
expect text "Morph target: 3"
expect text "Slot 0  Morph 3:"
shot morph-target
